### Formula for Moments of Binomial Distributions

From Eq. 1.81\(-\)Eq. 1.84, moments of BD are given by:

\[m_{1} =\frac{d}{dt}\sum_{k=0}\frac{N!}{k!(N-k)!}p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_{ t=0}\] \[=\sum_{k=0}\frac{kN!}{k!(N-k)!}p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_{t=0}\] \[=\sum_{k=1}\frac{Npe^{t}(N-1)!}{(k-1)!(N-k)!}p^{k-1}e^{(k-1)t}(1- p)^{N-k}|_{t=0}\] \[\Downarrow x=k-1\] (A.30) \[=\sum_{x=0}\frac{Npe^{t}(N-1)!}{x!(N-1-x))!}p^{x}e^{tx}(1-p)^{N-1 -x}|_{t=0}\] \[=Npe^{t}(1-p+pe^{t})^{N-1}|_{t=0}\] \[=Np\] (A.31)

where \(\frac{kN!}{k!(N-k)!}p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_{t=0,k=0}=0\).

\[m_{2} =\frac{d}{dt}\sum_{k=0}\frac{kN!}{k!(N-k)!}p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}| _{t=0}\] \[=\sum_{k=0}\frac{k^{2}N!}{k!(N-k)!}p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_{t=0}\] \[=\sum_{k=1}\frac{N!}{(N-k)!}[\frac{k-1}{(k-1)!}+\frac{1}{(k-1)!} ]p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_{t=0}\] \[\Downarrow x=k-1\] (A.32) \[=\sum_{x=0}\frac{xpe^{t}N(N-1)!}{x!(N-1-x))!}p^{x}e^{tx}(1-p)^{N -1-x}|_{t=0}+Np\] \[=N(N-1)p^{2}e^{2t}(1-p+pe^{t})^{N-2}|_{t=0}+Np\] \[=N^{2}p^{2}+Np(1-p)\] (A.33)\[m_{3} =\frac{d}{dt}\sum_{k}\frac{k^{2}N!}{k!(N-k)!}p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_ {t=0}\] \[=\sum_{k}\frac{k^{3}N!}{k!(N-k)!}p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_{t=0}\] \[=\sum_{k}\frac{N!}{(N-k)!}[\frac{(k-1)(k-2)+3(k-1)+1}{(k-1)!}]p^{k }e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_{t=0}\] \[=N(N-1)(N-2)p^{3}e^{3t}(1-p+pe^{t})^{N-3}|_{t=0}+3[N^{2}p^{2}+Np(1 -p)]+Np\] \[=N(N-1)(N-2)p^{3}+3N(N-1)p^{2}+Np\] \[=N^{3}p^{3}-3N^{2}p^{2}(1-p)+Np(1-3p+2p^{2})\] (A.34) \[m_{4} =\frac{d}{dt}\sum_{k}\frac{k^{3}N!}{k!(N-k)!}p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N- k}|_{t=0}\] \[=\sum_{k}\frac{k^{4}N!}{k!(N-k)!}p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_{t=0}\] \[=\sum_{k}\frac{N!}{(N-k)!}[\frac{(k-1)(k-2)(k-3)+6(k-1)(k-2)+7(k- 1)+6}{(k-1)!}]p^{k}e^{kt}(1-p)^{N-k}|_{t=0}\] \[=N(N-1)(N-2)(N-3)p^{4}e^{4t}(1-p+pe^{t})^{N-4}|_{t=0}\] \[\quad+6N(N-1)(N-2)p^{3}+7N(N-1)p^{2}+6Np\] \[=N(N-1)(N-2)(N-3)p^{4}+6N(N-1)(N-2)p^{3}+7N(N-1)p^{2}+Np\] \[=N^{4}p^{4}-6N^{3}p^{3}(1-p)+N^{2}p^{2}(7-18p+11p^{2})+Np(1-7p+12 p^{2}-6p^{3})\] (A.35)

### Formula for Cumulants of Binomial Distributions

According to the definition of the cumulants of BD Eq. 1.80, we have the expression for various order cumulants of BD:

\[C_{1} =N\frac{d}{dt}ln(1-p+pe^{t})|_{t=0}=N\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}}|_{ t=0}\] \[=Np\] (A.36) \[C_{2} =N\frac{d^{2}}{dt^{2}}ln(1-p+pe^{t})|_{t=0}=N\frac{d}{dt}\frac{pe ^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}}|_{t=0}\] \[=N\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}}|_{t=0}-N(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^{2 }|_{t=0}\] \[=Np(1-p)\] (A.37)\[C_{3} =N\frac{d^{3}}{dt^{3}}ln(1-p+pe^{t})|_{t=0}=N\frac{d}{dt}[\frac{pe^{t }}{1-p+pe^{t}}-(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^{2}]|_{t=0}\] \[=N\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}}|_{t=0}-3N(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^{2 }|_{t=0}+2N(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^{3}|_{t=0}\] \[=Np(1-p)(1-2p)\] \[=Np(1-3p+2p^{2})\] (A.38) \[C_{4} =N\frac{d^{3}}{dt^{3}}ln(1-p+pe^{t})|_{t=0}\] \[=N\frac{d}{dt}[\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}}-3(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{ t}})^{2}+2(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^{3}]|_{t=0}\] \[=N\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}}|_{t=0}-7N(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^ {2}|_{t=0}+12N(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^{3}|_{t=0}\] \[\quad-6N(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^{4}|_{t=0}\] \[=Np(1-7p+12p^{2}-6p^{3})\] (A.39)

Usually, we have:

\[\frac{d}{dt}(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^{n}|_{t=0} =n(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t}})^{n}|_{t=0}-n(\frac{pe^{t}}{1-p+pe^{t }})^{n+1}|_{t=0}\] \[=np^{n}-np^{n+1}\] \[=np^{n}(1-p)\] (A.40)

